The tracker page loads these libraries and fonts at runtime from public CDNs.
They are not bundled in this repository and remain under their own licenses:
  - PDF.js 3.11.174 (Mozilla, Apache License 2.0), to read resume PDFs
  - jsPDF 2.5.1 (MIT License), to save cover letters as PDF
  - JSZip 3.10.1 (MIT License or GPLv3, at your choice), to save cover letters as Word files
  - Schibsted Grotesk and JetBrains Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via Google Fonts
